<title>USA: U.S. DAP prices flat, ammonia slightly lower.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP prices flat, ammonia slightly lower.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate prices were steady and ammonia prices were slightly lower on Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>Recent rains in the Midwest have halted the application of fertilizer and slowed dealings in the cash markets, sources said.</p>
<p>				  Dlrs/short ton  Chg from Monday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   180-182			unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     188-190			unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	   225-228			dn 2-3</p>
<p>--(Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720)</p>
